<Solution>
  <Folder Name="/tests/">
    <Project Path="ISO15118ConformanceTests.Simulation/ISO15118ConformanceTests.Simulation.csproj" />
    <Project Path="ISO15118ConformanceTests.Pqc/ISO15118ConformanceTests.Pqc.csproj" />
    <!-- The app's own codec tests, carried into this solution deliberately: they hold the byte-exact
         cross-checks against cbV2G and against Josev's EXIficient-encoded frames. The code they test
         is the app's, but a foreign encoder as oracle is the one thing the loopback E2Es and our own
         session corpus cannot be — so the offline judgement runs them here too. -->
    <Project Path="libs/EVSimulatorApp/libs/WWCP_ISO15118/WWCP_ISO15118_EXI_Tests/WWCP_ISO15118_EXI_Tests.csproj" />
    <!-- The transport's own unit tests — backend selection and the TlsOptions → BcTlsOptions bridge.
         They travelled with the session code on 2026-08-08 and landed in a solution this one does not
         include, so for a day the offline gate did not run them. Carried here for the same reason as
         the codec tests above: `dotnet test` from this repository is what decides the stack is green,
         and a test that only runs in the app's solution is a test this repository cannot vouch for. -->
    <Project Path="libs/EVSimulatorApp/libs/WWCP_ISO15118/WWCP_ISO15118_Session_Tests/WWCP_ISO15118_Session_Tests.csproj" />
  </Folder>
